    <description><![CDATA[<h3>McKellar-Sipes Regional Airport (MKL)</h3><p>Jackson, West region<br/>Runway 2-20, Reconstruction<br/>Construction 2027, 30 years at 3%</p><table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0"><tr><th>Alternative</th><th>Type</th><th>Initial</th><th>Net present worth</th><th>Closure days</th><th>Section</th></tr><tr><td>Alternative 1</td><td>HMA-New</td><td align="right">$12,372,457</td><td align="right">$16,528,084</td><td align="right">94</td><td>11" P401 on 8" P209 on 8" P154</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative 2</td><td>PCC-New</td><td align="right">$13,830,666</td><td align="right">$14,066,568</td><td align="right">36</td><td>9" P501 on 8" P209 on 8" P154</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative 3</td><td>HMA-New</td><td align="right">$14,671,662</td><td align="right">$18,827,288</td><td align="right">94</td><td>13" P401 on 13" P209</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative 4</td><td>PCC-New</td><td align="right">$14,418,903</td><td align="right">$14,594,219</td><td align="right">36</td><td>11" P501 on 8" P209</td></tr></table><p><b>Lowest present worth: Alternative 2   |   margin to next: $527,651   |   3% over 30 years   |   lost revenue: Yes</b><br/>Same lowest-cost alternative at 2% (OMB A-94 real rate, FAA PGL 22-01)   |   same at 7% (pre-2022 AIP rule)</p>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#airport</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-88.915610,35.599880,0</coordinates></Point>
